<section class="bhd-page__prose-grid">
  <article class="bhd-page__prose">
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Creator standard</p>
    <h2>Useful content over forced promotion</h2>
    <p>We prefer credible, practical content to scripted enthusiasm. Creators should be able to explain the relationship clearly and communicate in their own voice.</p>
    <p>We do not ask creators to hide compensation, fabricate testimonials, guarantee outcomes or present individual experience as proof of efficacy.</p>
  </article>
  <aside class="bhd-page__callout">
    <span class="bhd-page__callout-label">Interested?</span>
    <h3>Send the audience, channel and idea.</h3>
    <p>That is enough for us to assess fit before anyone builds a campaign.</p>
  </aside>
</section>

<section class="bhd-page__brand-context">
  <div>
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Create with us</p>
